@cc [owner:id13,label:cli] dfs-startup-opt-in
The mprocs and process-compose launchers MUST NOT require or check the native FoundationDB
client during default startup. DFS processes MUST be disabled by default. The client check
MUST run when a developer explicitly starts DFS.

@cc [owner:id13,label:error-handling] fdb-probe-api-initialization
The FoundationDB client probe MUST successfully select the required API version before calling
`fdb_get_client_version`. Unsupported API versions MUST fail the check without calling it.
